### 1. GET 查詢所有房型
GET http://localhost:8081/api/roomtypes
Authorization: Basic vic1 111

### 2. GET 查詢單一房型 (例如 ID = 1)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/roomtypes/1
Authorization: Basic vic1 111

### 3. POST 新增房型 (新增資料庫第 xx 筆「海景尊榮房」)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/roomtypes
Authorization: Basic vic1 111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeName": "海景1111尊榮房",
  "bedType": "一張加大1111雙人床",
  "description": "很有 111feel",
  "pricePerNight": 3500,
  "capacity": 1,
  "imageId": 10
}

### 4. PUT 修改房型資訊 (修改 ID = xx 的資料)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/roomtypes/12
Authorization: Basic vic1 111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeName": "海景尊榮房(已修改)",
  "bedType": "一張加大雙人床",
  "description": "超有 feel，含雙人早餐與精選紅酒",
  "pricePerNight": 4200,
  "capacity": 2,
  "imageId": 10
}

### 5. DELETE 刪除房型 (刪除 ID = xx 的資料)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/roomtypes/12
Authorization: Basic vic1 111